Limitations
- The preregistered confirmatory readiness gate failed. Exploratory intervals
  cannot be cited as the confirmatory primary result.
- Both models share OpenCode Go, so provider effects and cross-provider
  generalization are not identified.
- OpenCode Go exposes catalog listings, not immutable serving-weight hashes.
- The provider exposes no unified sampling seed; repeated calls are not
  byte-deterministic model outputs.
- The benchmark has 24 project-owned synthetic tasks and one environment seed.
